---
const testimonials = [
  {
    name: "Glenda Comai",
    role: "Group Leader @NeuroPSI Paris Saclay",
    opinion:
      "❝ I had the plesure to have Giada as colleague for a few years at the Pasteur Institute. Giada impressed me in several ways. First, she was able to implement a new experimental system in the lab involving organoids, grasping very quickly a whole set of related biological concepts and the wealth of litterature in this expanding field of research. Her attention to detail and positive attitude for problem solving situations were probably key in the sucess of her challenging project. Finally, Giada always showed outstanding presentation skills over lab meetings and seminars, and she was able to foster a positive, calm and productive working environment. ❞",
  },
  {
    name: "Michiel Tawdarous",
    role: "PhD Student @Institut Pasteur",
    opinion:
      "❝ Working under Giada’s supervision during my M2 internship was a great opportunity to learn a lot at the bench. A very precise cell biologist, she taught me how to properly design an experiment and not to be dispersed. She was always pushing questions and trying to push the limits of in vitro modeling, challenging and critical of what is in the literature. Experiment failure was not considered a failure but a door opening new questions that can have critical impact. ❞",
  },
  {
    name: "Melania Murolo",
    role: "Postdoctoral Scientist @Institut Pasteur",
    opinion:
      "❝ Giada is an extremely proactive, creative, and smart professional who always stands out for her positive attitude and willingness to support her colleagues whenever needed. One of her greatest strengths is undoubtedly her problem-solving ability. She approaches challenges with determination, practical thinking, and efficiency. During the years we worked together, she consistently demonstrated a remarkable ability to learn quickly and apply new knowledge immediately, always achieving excellent results. Her adaptability, teamwork skills, and dedication make her an incredible asset to any team or organization. ❞",
  },
];
// Function to calculate `data-aos-duration` based on index
function calculateAosDuration(index) {
  return 1500 + index * 500; // Example: Increment duration by 500ms for each project
}
---

<section class="bg-primary">
  <div class="px-8 2xl:max-w-7xl mx-auto py-6">
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="h-0.5 bg-secondary"></div>
      <h3 class="text-secondary text-base font-medium">
        <span>human</span>
        <span class="font-bold">opinions</span>
      </h3>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col text-secondary pt-2 mt-2 gap-12 lg:gap-32">
      {
        testimonials.map((opinion, index) => (
          <div
            data-aos="fade-up"
            data-aos-duration={calculateAosDuration(index)}
            class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:items-end lg:grid-cols-4 py-4 gap-4"
          >
            <p class="text-2xl  lg:col-span-3 lg:text-4xl  indent-32 lg:indent-32">
              {opinion.opinion}
            </p>
            <p class="italic text-xs block ">
              {opinion.name} {opinion.role}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
